.docname {Controls reference}
.include {docs}

Every keyboard and mouse control in one place. Shortcuts with a command modifier use Cmd on macOS and Ctrl elsewhere; this page shows the key for the platform you are reading on.

Board shortcuts work while the board has keyboard focus. They are disabled while a dialog is open, or while a text field or the speed slider is focused; press .keybinding {Esc} or click the board to get them back. In-app, press .keybinding {/} for the same list.

> Tip: When you move through the controls with .keybinding {Tab}, the board is the last stop, and it gets a bright outline when it has focus. While the board is outlined, .keybinding {Space} and the other board shortcuts apply to it again. .keybinding {Shift+Tab} from the first toolbar button jumps straight back to it.

## Simulation

| Key                     | Action                       |
|-------------------------|------------------------------|
| .keybinding {Space}     | Run or pause                 |
| .keybinding {J}         | Step one generation          |
| .keybinding {R}         | Randomize the board          |
| .keybinding {X}         | Clear the board              |
| .keybinding {0}         | Reset the generation counter |
| .keybinding {plus}      | Speed up (past 40 gen/s: ∞)   |
| .keybinding {minus}     | Slow down                    |
| .keybinding {M}         | Toggle wrapping or fixed edges |

## Editing

| Key or mouse                                 | Action                                      |
|----------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
| Left drag                                    | Draw or erase with the selected tool        |
| Left click, with a stamp selected            | Place the pattern                           |
| Right drag                                   | Erase                                       |
| .keybinding {U} or .keybinding {Mod+Z}       | Undo the last edit and pause                |
| .keybinding {Mod+Shift+Z}                    | Redo the last undone edit                   |

## Stamps

| Key                | Action                                |
|--------------------|---------------------------------------|
| .keybinding {Z}    | Rotate the stamp clockwise            |
| .keybinding {F}    | Flip the stamp horizontally           |
| .keybinding {C}    | Clear the active stamp                |

## View

| Key or mouse                                   | Action                          |
|------------------------------------------------|---------------------------------|
| Mouse wheel over the board, or **− / +** in the status bar | Zoom                    |
| Middle-button drag over the board             | Pan without editing cells       |
| .keybinding {W} .keybinding {A} .keybinding {S} .keybinding {D} or arrow keys | Pan          |
| .keybinding {V}, or **Fit board** in the status bar | Fit the whole board in view |
| .keybinding {T}                                | Toggle the grid                 |
| .keybinding {H}                                | Hide or show the pattern palette |
| .keybinding {F3}                               | Toggle diagnostics              |
| .keybinding {/}                                | Toggle help                     |
| .keybinding {Q}                                | Quit                            |

## Controls and dialogs

| Key                                         | Action                                                    |
|---------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------|
| .keybinding {Tab}, .keybinding {Shift+Tab}  | Move between controls                                     |
| .keybinding {Enter} or .keybinding {Space}  | Activate the focused button                               |
| .keybinding {Left}, .keybinding {Right}     | Change speed, with the slider focused                     |
| .keybinding {Home}, .keybinding {End}       | 1 or 40 gen/s, with the slider focused             |
| .keybinding {Esc}                           | Close a dialog, or leave a text field or the slider       |
| .keybinding {Mod+C}, .keybinding {Mod+X}, .keybinding {Mod+V}, .keybinding {Mod+A} | Copy, cut, paste, and select all in text fields |
| .keybinding {Shift} + arrow keys            | Select text in text fields                                |
